{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p060a","title":"钟毓代夏侯玄作辞夏侯玄不与钟会狎交","accounts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p060a-account","label":"《世语》","text":"钟毓代夏侯玄作辞夏侯玄不与钟会狎交","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p060a-q"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p060b-account","label":"孙盛《杂语》","text":"孙盛《杂语》称钟会在狱中欲狎而友夏侯玄，夏侯玄正色责其相逼。","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p060b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0093","role":"作辞","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p060a-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0064","role":"拒辞拒狎","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p060a-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0073","role":"求交","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p060a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"夏侯玄在廷尉时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-p060a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"xiahoucao-e-p060a-q","source_order":[9,620,"P060a"],"order":2358}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0064","name":"夏侯玄","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0073","name":"钟会","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0093","name":"钟毓","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p060a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-9afb2b26c98d661e766c","layer":"pei","quote":"至廷尉，不肯下辞。廷尉钟毓自临治玄。玄正色责毓曰：‘吾当何辞？卿为令史责人也！卿便为吾作。’毓以其名士，节高不可屈，而狱当竟；夜为作辞，令与事相附，流涕以示玄。玄视，颔之而已。毓弟会，年少于玄，玄不与交；是日于毓坐狎玄，玄不受。","attribution":"《世语》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":619,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-67eacb2cd751f5ee777c","start":10,"end":124},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p060b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-9afb2b26c98d661e766c","layer":"pei","quote":"玄在囹圄，会因欲狎而友玄。玄正色曰：‘钟君，何相逼如此也！","attribution":"孙盛《杂语》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":619,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-67eacb2cd751f5ee777c","start":134,"end":163}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
